 - Plan 1: about 1.25× for both, so a lot spoils (an estimated ~140+ units of item 1 at 11 each) and some is lost to the warehouse limit.\n  - Plan 2: exactly 1.0×.\n  - Plans 3 and 4: about 1.10× and 1.15×, the best level combined with the cheap 3-day ordering.\n- **Warehouse limit (176):** a 3-day batch at about 1.1× is 165–175 units. Add leftovers and some of each delivery is lost (plans 3 and 4, at days 14 and 17). Those units would mostly have spoiled anyway, so the loss is moderate.\n\n**Ranking**\n1. Plans 3 and 4: right quantities and 204 less in order fees than the 2-day plans.\n2. Plan 2: cheap ordering but a bit short.\n3. Plan 6: best of the every-2-day plans.\n4. Plans 0 and 7: next.\n5. Plan 1: over-orders.\n6. Plan 5: order fees too high.\n\nPlans 2 and 6 are the closest call for the fourth place in the top half."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4934, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4934}, "output_tokens": 10, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T09:13:11.399Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWGe3zpE5axTZCEnbBNU"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017gbf95hSg7Qf6xWnY5BL8i", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWGe4GgP7zLVWj48oSRX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_017gbf95hSg7Qf6xWnY5BL8i", "name": "Struct